# MOVIEBUZZ Documentation

- **API_KEYS.md** — how to get the free TMDB key and where it lives (never in Git)
- **.github/README.txt** — the CI workflow for automatic APK builds, ready to add
- **README.md** (repo root) — setup, import formats, security, testing overview

The local-first design means everything personal — library, ratings, reviews,
lists, statistics, AI recommendations, backup/restore — works with no internet
and no keys at all.
